                "description": "Baldwin Clear Glass Fillmore 5080 Knob With 5048 Rosette - This Baldwin made knobset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. The time honored elegance of the Fillmore Knob is illustrated in the fine cuts in the glass as well as in the the classic rose. Everything about this knobset is reminiscent of sophistication and beauty. It is available in five stunning finishes.",
